      "created_at": "2016-10-15T03:33:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Whoever creates the room can select which expansions (that they own) are available. Anyone else who wants to join the room has to own the expansions that the creator selected. So, if your friends only own the base game, you would only be able to use base game heroes/villains/environments when playing with them.</p>",
